{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974671-know-your-gods-cosmology-thread","id":974671,"title":"Know Your Gods [Cosmology Thread]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-22T14:38:44-07:00","id":974671,"title":"Know Your Gods [Cosmology Thread]","content":"So every once and a while, I start musing about the &quot;true nature&quot; of the CofD's Cosmology and divinities. While there are variations from time to time, it always ends up as some sort of polytheistic system, with some fundamental powers which create lesser gods, which create or protect the many different critters of the setting. While each of those different forces has its own origin, the common thread is that all of them are the &quot;first&quot; of something- and that by being the first, they changed the world. Anyway, after finding which realms, beings and phenomena I believe should come from such &quot;fundamental divinity&quot;, I've hit few mental blocks and weren't sure how to carry on- so help at developing the blank ideas would be welcomed. Notice that it is a mix of canon, semi canon and pure homebrew, so if something isn't clear feel free to ask :P<br /> <br /> The Darkness- Fallen/Horrors/Mortals- the Thing in the Dark, the Crack, Robs of Night and Silence, the First Horror<br /> <br /> The Source- Witches/Thaumaturges- Mother Earth, Living Magic, Flow of Life and Fate, the First ???<br /> <br /> Omphalos- Psychics/Goetia/Body Thieves/Astral- the Serpent, Whose Venom Devours Dreams, Keeper of Past and Future, the First ???<br /> <br /> ???- Skinthieves- ???<br /> <br /> Nature- Changing Breeds- Careless Mother, She Who Gifts, Lady in Red and Green, the First Breath<br /> <br /> ???- Old Ones- ???<br /> <br /> The Adversary- Inferno/Possessed/Lucifuge- Prince of Darkness, the Fire Bellow the World, King of Vice and Passion, the First Sin<br /> <br /> ???- Slashers- ???<br /> <br /> The Rite- Blood Bathers- Giver of Life, the Original, Miracle of Sacrifice and Blood, the First ???<br /> <br /> ???- Purified- ???<br /> <br /> ???- Dark Heroes- ???<br /> <br /> God Machine- Angels/Stigmatics/Infrastructures- The Broken Clockwork, Gears of the World, Mover of Heaven and Earth, the First Mechanism<br /> <br /> The Network- AI/Cyborgs-the Grid, Virtual Existence, Connection of Space and Time, the First Link<br /> <br /> God- Vampires/MM Hunters/Empyrean- the One, Father of All, Creator and Destroyer of Worlds, the First Divinity<br /> <br /> The Crone- Vampires/Ghouls/Dampyre- the Blood, Primordial Creation, Witch of Death and Chaos, the First Blood<br /> <br /> Lilith- Dis/Strix- Queen of Owls, False Life, Mirror of Blood and Smoke, the First Shadow<br /> <br /> Pazuzu- Eddimu/Iltani- Lord of the Wind, Screamer among the Stars, Demon of Plague and Drought, the First ???<br /> <br /> Kur- Alu- ???<br /> <br /> Tezcatlipoca- Cihuateteo- Smoking Mirror, the Jaguar, Devourer of Hearts and Souls, the First ???<br /> <br /> Dii Imortales- Cult of Augurs- the Masqueraded, Unseen Movement, Gods Great and Small, the First Empire<br /> <br /> Father Wolf- Pangaea/Werewolves/Hosts- Moon Lover, Guardian of the Bordermarch, Bane of Flesh and Spirit, the First Hunter<br /> <br /> Gaea- Hisil/Spirits- World's Shadow, Unseen Mother, Blood of Life and Death, the First Spirit<br /> <br /> Ain Soph- Star Spirits- Unmoved Mover, Breath of all Life, Ripples in the Celestial River and Sea, the First ???<br /> <br /> Luna- Shapeshifters/Idigam- Earth Banished, Mad Silver Light, Changing Lady, the First Change<br /> <br /> Helios- ???- Everflame, Burning Lord of Light, King of Day and Fire, the First ???<br /> <br /> ???- Unclean- ???<br /> <br /> Sea- Brineborn/Drowned- Eternal Dread, the Deluge, Endless Hunger and Despair, the First ???<br /> <br /> Oracles- Supernal/Mages- Lightbringers, Stars of Heaven, Watchtowers of Horn and Ivory, the First Soul<br /> <br /> Exrach- Lies/Seer- Kings of the Lie, Iron Seals, Tyrants and Judges of Falsehoods, the First Lie<br /> <br /> Arawn- Annwn/Hounds- the Hunter, Unseen Threat, Hollow Beyond Light and Sound, the First ???<br /> <br /> Annunaki- Abyss/Scelesti- the Void, Darkness from the Outside, Lords of Madness and Oblivion, the First Deviation<br /> <br /> Father- Tremere- Maker of Souls, World Tree, Eater of Breath and Spirit, the First Dragon<br /> <br /> The Principle- Divine Fire/Prometheans/Alchemists/Qashmalim- the Firestorm, the Philosopher Stone, Hand of God and Heaven, the First Dogma<br /> <br /> The Mockery- Flux/Pandorans/Centimani- the Decay, Shadow of Corruption, That Which Rots and Breaks, the First Mistake<br /> <br /> Awful Ice- Cold Ones/Domemim- Heaven's Frost, Twilight of the Gods, Perfection Still and Silent, the First Regret<br /> <br /> Wyrd- Changelings/True Fae- Weaver of Tales, Songs of Troubadours, Fate of Beauty and Madness, the First Story<br /> <br /> Echo- Fetches- the Mimic, False Image, Hollow Laughter and Tears, the First Reflection<br /> <br /> ???- Huntsmen- ???<br /> <br /> The Tree- Hedge/Hobgoblins- the Thorns, Forbidden Fruit, Labyrinth of Fear and Pain, the First Wound<br /> <br /> Lady of Dreams- Skein/Incubi- Trader of Wishes, Collector of Lost Things, Watcher of Price and Pay, the First Wish<br /> <br /> The Vigil- Hunters- Legion of Candles, Falling Scales, Protector of Light and Shadow, the First ???<br /> <br /> Director's Board- Cheiron Group- ???<br /> <br /> Faceless Angels- Knights of St George- the Seventy Two, Last Hope, Slayers of Dragons and Serpents, the First ???<br /> <br /> Hecate- Promethean Brotherhood- Warden of Crossroads, Black Path of Magic, Thief of Stars and Moons, the First Heresy<br /> <br /> Ocean of Fragments- Underworld/Ghosts/Bound- Death, End of All Rivers, Sea Beyond Life and Darkness, the First Tear<br /> <br /> ???- Chtonians- ???<br /> <br /> ???- Kereboi- ???<br /> <br /> ???-Abmortals-???<br /> <br /> Law of Suffering- Arisen- the Sacrifice, Nameless Ones, Forty Two Crimes and Punishments, the First Law<br /> <br /> The Devourer- Shaunsken/Amkhat- Primordial Hunger, She Who Waits, Ocean of Endings and Oblivion, the First Hunger<br /> <br /> Fate- Deceived/Aaru- Cold Stars of Eternity, Path of Light, Spheres of Music and Divinity, the First Plan<br /> <br /> Sutekh- Apotheosis/Sha Beasts- the Unjudged, Will of Heaven, Staff of Names and Sacrifice, the First Will<br /> <br /> Khepera- Sekhem- the Scarab, Word of All Things, That Which is Creator and Created, the First ???<br /> <br /> Satan Signal- Demons- Call for Arms, Fallen Light, Song of Challenge and Defiance, the First Rebellion<br /> <br /> Raziel- Exiled- Keeper of Secrets, Master of Words, Book of Machines and Stars, the First Exile<br /> <br /> Samyaza- Cryptid- Lord Among Beasts, the Living Devil, Breaker of Cog and Chain, the First ???<br /> <br /> Dark Mother- Beasts/Primordial Dream- Mother of Monsters, the Primal Nightmare, Dream of Dread and Hunger, the First Fear<br /> <br /> ???- Heroes- ???","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 09-24-2016, 03:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T14:51:50-07:00","id":974680,"title":"","content":"The Adversary is, I believe, linked with the Demiurge by the Belial's Brood. I'm not entirely sure on that, it's been a while, but both are mentioned in that book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T15:22:25-07:00","id":974699,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974671-know-your-gods-cosmology-thread?p=974680#post974680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Adversary is, I believe, linked with the Demiurge by the Belial's Brood. I'm not entirely sure on that, it's been a while, but both are mentioned in that book.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, I've took the name right from Inferno, as how the &quot;10 Rank Demon&quot; was called. I've also haven't read Belial's Brood for a long time, but I don't think it would be that far fetched that they are tied to Inferno, one way or another. I'll give it a look.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T15:30:32-07:00","id":974701,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974671-know-your-gods-cosmology-thread?p=974699#post974699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, I've took the name right from Inferno, as how the &quot;10 Rank Demon&quot; was called. I've also haven't read Belial's Brood for a long time, but I don't think it would be that far fetched that they are tied to Inferno, one way or another. I'll give it a look.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh I know it's in Inferno, I was just adding as you said you hit a few blocks.<br /> <br /> From the book's Lexicon, though it goes into it further in the text I'm not going to look for it right now, 'Adversary, the: The common name among Forsworn for the source of the vampiric soul, the one true \u201cdeity\u201d of all vampires. Some ascribe to it the traits of the Judeo-Christian Lucifer, while others feel the scope of the Adversary is beyond such familiarity. (Also Demiurge.)'<br /> <br /> The Forsworn are, of course, the Brood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T17:17:48-07:00","id":974767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974671-know-your-gods-cosmology-thread#post974671\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So every once and a while, I start musing about the &amp;quot;true nature&amp;quot; of the CofD's Cosmology and divinities. While there are variations from time to time, it always ends up as some sort of polytheistic system, with some fundamental powers which create lesser gods, which create or protect the many different critters of the setting. While each of those different forces has its own origin, the common thread is that all of them are the &amp;quot;first&amp;quot; of something- and that by being the first, they changed the world. Anyway, after finding which realms, beings and phenomena I believe should come from such &amp;quot;fund