s- the Thorns, Forbidden Fruit, Labyrinth of Fear and Pain, the First Wound<br /> <br /> Lady of Dreams- Skein/Incubi- Trader of Wishes, Collector of Lost Things, Watcher of Price and Pay, the First Wish<br /> <br /> The Vigil- Hunters- Legion of Candles, Falling Scales, Protector of Light and Shadow, the First ???<br /> <br /> Director's Board- Cheiron Group- ???<br /> <br /> Faceless Angels- Knights of St George- the Seventy Two, Last Hope, Slayers of Dragons and Serpents, the First ???<br /> <br /> Hecate- Promethean Brotherhood- Warden of Crossroads, Black Path of Magic, Thief of Stars and Moons, the First Heresy<br /> <br /> Ocean of Fragments- Underworld/Ghosts/Bound- Death, End of All Rivers, Sea Beyond Life and Darkness, the First Tear<br /> <br /> ???- Chtonians- ???<br /> <br /> ???- Kereboi- ???<br /> <br /> ???-Abmortals-???<br /> <br /> Law of Suffering- Arisen- the Sacrifice, Nameless Ones, Forty Two Crimes and Punishments, the First Law<br /> <br /> The Devourer- Shaunsken/Amkhat- Primordial Hunger, She Who Waits, Ocean of Endings and Oblivion, the First Hunger<br /> <br /> Fate- Deceived/Aaru- Cold Stars of Eternity, Path of Light, Spheres of Music and Divinity, the First Plan<br /> <br /> Sutekh- Apotheosis/Sha Beasts- the Unjudged, Will of Heaven, Staff of Names and Sacrifice, the First Will<br /> <br /> Satan Signal- Demons- Call for Arms, Fallen Light, Song of Challenge and Defiance, the First Rebellion<br /> <br /> Raziel- Exiled- Keeper of Secrets, Master of Words, Book of Machines and Stars, the First Exile<br /> <br /> Samyaza- Cryptid- Lord Among Beasts, the Living Devil, Breaker of Cog and Chain, the First ???<br /> <br /> Dark Mother- Beasts/Primordial Dream- Mother of Monsters, the Primal Nightmare, Dream of Dread and Hunger, the First Fear<br /> <br /> ???- Heroes- ???</div> </div> </div> </div> Some of these things are the samething.<br /> <br /> Fetches and Huntsmen are created by the True Fae, if your looking for a god higher then the True Fae, beings that can be universes, then I'd go for the Wyrd for all them.<br /> <br /> The faceless Angels are just Abyssal creatures, so just go with the Annunaki for them too. The Principle is the source for Flux too.<br /> <br /> Each of the Supenal Realms might be a Rank 10 Supernal Creature, its been hinted at, so the Oracles and Exarchs are smaller then that.<br /> <br /> The Crone and the Dark Mother MIGHT be the same being, its unknown.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T21:35:55-07:00","id":974877,"title":"","content":"Maybe I missed her, but where's Hecate?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T22:40:33-07:00","id":974894,"title":"","content":"I think horrors and slashers should be made by the Dark Mother.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T00:11:58-07:00","id":974922,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974671-know-your-gods-cosmology-thread?p=974894#post974894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think horrors and slashers should be made by the Dark Mother.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cannonly- definitely could be! Under this paradigm, in which every phenomenon has a different root, it's not the case- the Dark Mother is the power behind Beasts and the Primordial Dream, which is something specific, while Slashers are people who became monsters by their own violation while Horrors simply defy definition (hence why they are part of the sphere of &quot;the Darkness&quot;, which is the general &quot;fundamental power&quot; for &quot;this world is messed up&quot;). In this cosmology, if the Dark Mother is the mother of monsters is because she is the First Fear, from which many other primal forces were created.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T00:16:00-07:00","id":974924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flyboy254</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974671-know-your-gods-cosmology-thread?p=974877#post974877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe I missed her, but where's Hecate?</div> </div> </div> </div>this falls to the category of &quot;semi canon&quot;- the Endowment of the Brotherhood is, after all, called &quot;the Rite of Hecate&quot;, and one of the things I've toyed with for a long time was the origin of the ritual, which eventually led into Hecate being the &quot;lost Oracle of the Abyss&quot; which walked into the Land of Crossroads herself in order to create a path through which the Supernal Light of the Watchtower could reach the Fallen. Again, this is all head canon :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T00:44:25-07:00","id":974927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974671-know-your-gods-cosmology-thread?p=974767#post974767\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Some of these things are the samething.<br /> <br /> Fetches and Huntsmen are created by the True Fae, if your looking for a god higher then the True Fae, beings that can be universes, then I'd go for the Wyrd for all them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just a little correction- the Huntsmen are not created by the True Fae, if I remember correctly. They are stories older than the Gentry which are awakened by them in order to serve them as hunters. Now, yes, your are right- those two could easily be part of the Wyrd- and canonly they are. But one of the things I've toyed with for long time is creating a &quot;Fetch&quot; to the Wyrd (because Fetches are one of the things I really like at Changeling and I wish there were rules for fully playable ones). The result was &quot;the Echo&quot;, a force of mimicry which lacks existence of its own and fully depends on the Wyrd in order to react to it. It was created by the Wyrd because every good protagonist requires an antagonist to stand in its way. As for the Huntsmen- under thing cosmology, the Wyrd is the First Story, while the Huntsmen are stories older than mankind. I thought it would be interesting to tie them to something far older and much more primal than the Wyrd itself.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The faceless Angels are just Abyssal creatures, so just go with the Annunaki for them too. The Principle is the source for Flux too. </div> </div> </div>The Faceless Angels were never canonly said to be Abyssal Beings. While I do usually use them as such (out of pure symmetry), I've also made 3 different origin stories for them (as astral beings, god machine angels and infernal demons), and in order to maintain their nature as enigma I've kept them separated. The Mockery is, of course, purely head canon- the result of my trying to decide whether I should tear the Principle to two opposing forces of Elpis and Flux or keep it as one. As a compromise, I've made the Mockery as a separate, yet related being- as you may notice, the Principle has the Divine Fire as whole as part of its portfolio, including Flux and Lilithim. The Mockery controls only Flux, and even then only as consequences for its connection for the Principle- it is the First Mistake which was ever done by the Principle, and it serves as some sort of &quot;pandoran&quot; to the Principle's efforts.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Each of the Supenal Realms might be a Rank 10 Supernal Creature, its been hinted at, so the Oracles and Exarchs are smaller then that. </div> </div> </div>never liked the &quot;each Supernal Realm is a 10 Rank being&quot;, and it was mentioned only once, I think. The Supernal is limitless, and is defined into 5 such places only by the Watchtowers (at least, in this cosmology). The Oracles are the Watchtowers, which are the Supernal. The Exrachs have conquered the Supernal and made the Lie to become its kings. In sort, humanity (both as Oracles and Exrachs) has conquered the Supernal- and as such, the Supernal Realms, even if they are independent beings, can not be of higher &quot;Rank&quot; then its kings and queen. The Exrachs are the Lie, and the Oracles are the Supernal.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The Crone and the Dark Mother MIGHT be the same being, its unknown. </div> </div> </div>The Crone in this cosmology is interpreted a bit differently then how she may be in canon- she is the Blood, the flow of Vitae, every Beast which roars in dead heart. She is the very concept of vamprisim, the bleeding wound which has been cut in so many different ways. She is the drug in the bite and the blood and the blush of life which masks the death. She is not a mother, for she never birthed anyone- but she is, and she always would be as long as blood is spilled- for blood always keeps on flowing, and it always requires an heart to flow to. (I have originally to simply call her as &quot;the Blood&quot;, but I've preferred to use a term from Vampire's setting instead).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T03:48:12-07:00","id":974973,"title":"","content":"Nice list, but many entries could be connected. And more importantly - all of them would be trump by <i>Ain Soph</i> - it simply should be 'Rank 11', Creator of Everything. He probably started Big Bang and any other magical processes that ended in creating other gods of this list. He may or maybe not Judeochristian God of vampires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-23-2016, 06:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T06:36:08-07:00","id":975026,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974671-know-your-gods-cosmology-thread?p=974973#post974973\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nice list, but many entries could be connected. And more importantly - all of them would be trump by <i>Ain Soph</i> - it simply should be 'Rank 11', Creator of Everything. He probably started Big Bang and any other magical processes that ended in creating other gods of this list. He may or maybe not Judeochristian God of vampires.</div> </div> </div> </div>In my cosmology, if there is such &quot;Rank 11&quot; being, it is so far beyond human mind that it can't even be grasped- all of those Rank 10 beings are already so far beyond mortal (and monster) mind that they are seen as no more than forces of nature of laws of reality. Something even more fundamental simply can not be grasped by, well, anyone. God is, however, in the list (still haven't fully decided if the Lacea God is God of the Empyrean) as the &quot;First Divinity&quot;- he is equal to all the rest of the powers that be, being different simply by being the first. Ain Sop, on the other hand, is the Shadow of outer space and distant stars, a twin brother of Gaea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T12:13:56-07:00","id":975161,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974671-know-your-gods-cosmology-thread?p=975026#post975026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my cosmology, if there is such &quot;Rank 11&quot; being, it is so far beyond human mind that it can't even be grasped- all of those Rank 10 beings are already so far beyond mortal (and monster) mind that they are seen as no more than forces of nature of laws of reality. Something even more fundamental simply can not be grasped by, well, anyone.</div> </div> </div> </div>And it's <i>literal</i> definition of Ain Soph - <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ein_Sof\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ein_Sof</a> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974671-know-your-gods-cosmology-thread?p=975026#post975026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ain Sop, on the other hand, is the Shadow of outer space and distant stars, a twin brother of Gaea.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, you mean here Azatoth, Spirit of Milky Way. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And 'genealogically', he would be 'father' to Gaea as she is still only one planet's Shadow Goddess. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-24-2016, 12:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-24T09:11:00-07:00","id":975546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974671-know-your-gods-cosmology-thread?p=975026#post975026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> Ain Sop, on the other hand, is the Shadow of outer space and distant stars, a twin brother of Gaea.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974671-know-your-gods-cosmology-thread?p=975161#post975161\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, you mean here Azatoth, Spirit of Milky Way. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>If you want to take that mashup further, there's published Mythos that places Yog-Sothoth as the burning bush <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1289-hastur00","name":"Hastur00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1289_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-11T00:39:08-08:00","id":1280064,"title":"","content":"An evolution of this list please ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1038-mazarin","name":"Mazarin","avatar":"d